    {
      "name": "Presence",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "WebSocket Presence Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Presence is managed via WebSocket events (not REST API).\n\n**How it works:**\n- When a user connects via WebSocket → status = ONLINE\n- When a user disconnects → status = OFFLINE, lastSeen = current timestamp\n\n**Subscribe to presence updates:**\nTopic: `/topic/presence`\n\n**Payload example:**\n```json\n{\n    \"userId\": \"uuid-here\",\n    \"status\": \"ONLINE\",\n    \"lastSeen\": null\n}\n```\n\n**Disconnect payload:**\n```json\n{\n    \"userId\": \"uuid-here\",\n    \"status\": \"OFFLINE\",\n    \"lastSeen\": \"2026-03-15T12:30:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\nUser status is also included in the GET /api/users/me and GET /api/users/{id} responses (status and lastSeen fields)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "User presence (online/offline) is tracked via WebSocket session events and broadcast on /topic/presence. User status and lastSeen are also available in user API responses."
    }
